{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.01","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.1","question_text":"P3 例1.1：设 \\(f(x+1/x)=\\frac{x+x^3}{1+x^4}\\)，则当 \\(x\\ge2\\) 时，\\(f(x)=\\underline{\\hspace{2cm}}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：将 \\(x+1/x\\) 视为整体。\\(f(x+1/x)=\\frac{x+x^3}{1+x^4}=\\frac{x+1/x}{x^2+1/x^2}=\\frac{x+1/x}{(x+1/x)^2-2}\\)，所以当 \\(x\\ge2\\) 时 \\(f(x)=\\frac{x}{x^2-2}\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[1],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[9,10],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":null,"answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"rejected_placeholder","rejection_reason":"非逐题逐式原页视觉转写；包含摘要、入口文本或模板语句。","question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.02","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.2","question_text":"例1.2：设函数 \\(f(x)\\) 的定义域为 \\((0,+\\infty)\\)，且满足 \\(2f(x)+x^2f(1/x)=\\frac{x^2+2x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\)，则 \\(f(x)=\\underline{\\hspace{2cm}}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：原方程 \\(2f(x)+x^2f(1/x)=\\frac{x^2+2x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\)。将 \\(x\\) 换为 \\(1/x\\) 得 \\(2f(1/x)+x^{-2}f(x)=\\frac{1+2x}{x\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\)。联立消去 \\(f(1/x)\\)，得 \\(3f(x)=\\frac{3x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\)，所以 \\(f(x)=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[1],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[10],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":null,"answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"rejected_placeholder","rejection_reason":"非逐题逐式原页视觉转写；包含摘要、入口文本或模板语句。","question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.03","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.3","question_text":"P5 例1.3：求函数 \\(y=f(x)=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})\\) 的反函数 \\(f^{-1}(x)\\) 的表达式及其定义域。","solution_text":"官方解答：由 \\(y=\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})\\) 得 \\(e^y=\\sqrt{x^2+1}+x\\)，并由 \\(-y=\\ln(\\sqrt{x^2+1}-x)\\) 联立，得到 \\(x=\\frac12(e^y-e^{-y})\\)。交换变量，\\(f^{-1}(x)=\\frac12(e^x-e^{-x}),\\ -\\infty<x<+\\infty\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[2],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[11,12],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":null,"answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"rejected_placeholder","rejection_reason":"非逐题逐式原页视觉转写；包含摘要、入口文本或模板语句。","question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.04","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.4","question_text":"例1.4：设 \\(f(x)=x^2\\)，\\(f[\\varphi(x)]=-x^2+2x+3\\)，且 \\(\\varphi(x)\\ge0\\)，求 \\(\\varphi(x)\\) 及其定义域与值域。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(f[\\varphi(x)]=\\varphi^2(x)=-x^2+2x+3\\)，且 \\(\\varphi(x)\\ge0\\)，故 \\(\\varphi(x)=\\sqrt{-x^2+2x+3}\\)。由被开方数非负得定义域 \\([-1,3]\\)，又 \\(-x^2+2x+3=-(x-1)^2+4\\)，值域为 \\([0,2]\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[2],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[13],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":null,"answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"rejected_placeholder","rejection_reason":"非逐题逐式原页视觉转写；包含摘要、入口文本或模板语句。","question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.05","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.5","question_text":"P8 例1.5：设 \\(g(x)=\\begin{cases}2-x,&x\\le0\\\\2+x,&x>0\\end{cases}\\)，\\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2,&x<0\\\\-x-1,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}\\)，则 \\(g[f(x)]=\\underline{\\hspace{2cm}}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：先按 \\(f(x)\\) 的正负确定 \\(g\\) 的分支。\\(x\\ge0\\) 时 \\(f(x)=-x-1\\le0\\)，\\(g[f(x)]=2-f(x)=3+x\\)；\\(x<0\\) 时 \\(f(x)=x^2>0\\)，\\(g[f(x)]=2+f(x)=2+x^2\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[3],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[14],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":null,"answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"rejected_placeholder","rejection_reason":"非逐题逐式原页视觉转写；包含摘要、入口文本或模板语句。","question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.06","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.6","question_text":"例1.6：证明函数 \\(f(x)=\\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\) 在 \\((−\\infty,+\\infty)\\) 内有界。","solution_text":"官方解答：当 \\(x\\ne0\\)，\\(|f(x)|=\\frac{|x|}{1+x^2}=\\frac1{|x|+1/|x|}\\le\\frac12\\)，并在 \\(x=0\\) 取0，故 \\(f(x)=\\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\) 在 \\((−\\infty,+\\infty)\\) 有界。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[3],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[15],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":null,"answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"rejected_placeholder","rejection_reason":"非逐题逐式原页视觉转写；包含摘要、入口文本或模板语句。","question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.07","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.7","question_text":"P10 例1.7：设 \\(f(x)\\) 在 \\((−\\infty,+\\infty)\\) 上有定义，任给 \\(x_1,x_2,x_1\\ne x_2\\)，均有 \\((x_1-x_2)[f(x_1)-f(x_2)]>0\\)，则以下函数一定单调递增的是（ ）。A. \\(|f(x)|\\)；B. \\(f(|x|)\\)；C. \\(f(-x)\\)；D. \\(-f(-x)\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：由已知 \\(f(x)\\) 为单调增加函数。\\(f(-x)\\) 的图像与 \\(f(x)\\) 的图像关于 \\(y\\) 轴对称，故 \\(f(-x)\\) 单调减少；\\(-f(-x)\\) 与 \\(f(x)\\) 的图像关于原点对称，故 \\(-f(-x)\\) 单调增加。应选 \\((D)\\)。\\(|f(x)|\\) 是否具有单调性与 \\(f(x)\\) 的正负相关，不能确定。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[4],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[16,17],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(D)：\\(-f(-x)\\) 单调增加。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.08","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.8","question_text":"例1.8：设对任意 \\(x,y\\)，都有 \\(f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y)\\)，证明：\\(f(x)\\) 是奇函数。","solution_text":"官方解答：令 \\(x=y=0\\)，由 \\(f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y)\\) 得 \\(f(0)=f(0)+f(0)\\)，于是 \\(f(0)=0\\)。再令 \\(y=-x\\)，得 \\(f(0)=f(x)+f(-x)\\)，即 \\(f(-x)=-f(x)\\)，故 \\(f(x)\\) 是奇函数。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[4],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[19],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(f(x)\\) 为奇函数。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.09","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.9","question_text":"P14 例1.9：设函数 \\(f(x)\\) 在 \\((−\\infty,+\\infty)\\) 上满足 \\(f(x)=f(x-\\pi)+\\sin x\\)，证明：\\(f(x)\\) 是以 \\(T=2\\pi\\) 为周期的周期函数。","solution_text":"官方解答：多次利用题目等式，有 \\(f(x+2\\pi)=f(x+\\pi)+\\sin(x+2\\pi)=f(x)+\\sin(x+\\pi)+\\sin(x+2\\pi)=f(x)\\)。故 \\(f(x)\\) 以 \\(T=2\\pi\\) 为周期。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[5],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[20],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(T=2\\pi\\) 为周期。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.10","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.10","question_text":"例1.10：设 \\(0<x<\\frac12\\)，求 \\(y(x)=x^6(1-x)^2(1-2x)^4\\) 的最大值点。","solution_text":"官方解答：取对数，\\(\\ln y=6\\ln x+2\\ln(1-x)+4\\ln(1-2x)\\)。令 \\(\\frac{d[\\ln y(x)]}{dx}=\\frac6x-\\frac2{1-x}-\\frac8{1-2x}=\\frac{24x^2-28x+6}{x(1-x)(1-2x)}=0\\)，即 \\(12x^2-14x+3=0\\)。解得 \\(x=\\frac{7\\pm\\sqrt{13}}{12}\\)；\\(\\frac{7+\\sqrt{13}}{12}>\\frac12\\) 不合题意，且 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0^+}y(x)=\\lim_{x\\to(1/2)^-}y(x)=0<y\\!\\left(\\frac{7-\\sqrt{13}}{12}\\right)\\)。因此最大值点为 \\(x=\\frac{7-\\sqrt{13}}{12}\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[5],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[21,22],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"最大值点 \\(x=\\frac{7-\\sqrt{13}}{12}\\)。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.11","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.11","question_text":"P18 例1.11：已知 \\(e^x=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^n}{n!},x\\in R\\)，则 \\(2^x=\\)（ ）。A. \\(\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(x\\ln2)^n}{n!}\\)；B. \\(\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(x\\ln2)^n}{n!}\\)；C. \\(\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(\\ln2)x^n}{n!}\\)；D. \\(\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(\\ln2)x^n}{n!}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(2^x=e^{x\\ln2}\\)。已知 \\(e^x=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^n}{n!}\\)，所以 \\(2^x=e^{x\\ln2}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(x\\ln2)^n}{n!}\\)。应选 \\((B)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[6],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[24],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(B)：\\(\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(x\\ln2)^n}{n!}\\)。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.12","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.12","question_text":"例1.12：设 \\(y=\\sin x,0\\le x\\le2\\pi\\)，求其所有单调区间上的反函数。","solution_text":"官方解答：分别讨论 \\(y=\\sin x\\) 在其单调区间上的反函数。当 \\(0\\le x\\le\\frac\\pi2\\) 时，\\(x=\\arcsin y,\\ y\\in[0,1]\\)，反函数为 \\(y=\\arcsin x,\\ x\\in[0,1]\\)。当 \\(\\frac\\pi2<x\\le\\frac{3\\pi}2\\) 时，\\(-\\frac\\pi2<x-\\pi\\le\\frac\\pi2\\)，\\(\\sin(x-\\pi)=-\\sin x=-y\\)，故 \\(x-\\pi=-\\arcsin y\\)，即 \\(x=\\pi-\\arcsin y,\\ y\\in[-1,1)\\)，反函数为 \\(y=\\pi-\\arcsin x,\\ x\\in[-1,1)\\)。当 \\(\\frac{3\\pi}2<x\\le2\\pi\\) 时，\\(-\\frac\\pi2<x-2\\pi\\le0\\)，\\(x-2\\pi=\\arcsin y\\)，故反函数为 \\(y=2\\pi+\\arcsin x,\\ x\\in(-1,0]\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[6],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[28],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"在各单调区间上，反函数依次为 \\(y=\\arcsin x\\;(x\\in[0,1])\\)，\\(y=\\pi-\\arcsin x\\;(x\\in[-1,1))\\)，\\(y=2\\pi+\\arcsin x\\;(x\\in(-1,0])\\)。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.13","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.13","question_text":"P26 例1.13：设 \\([x]\\) 表示不超过 \\(x\\) 的最大整数，则 \\(y=x-[x]\\) 是（A）无界函数（B）单调函数（C）偶函数（D）周期函数。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(y(x+1)=x+1-[x+1]=x+1-([x]+1)=x-[x]=y(x)\\)。所以 \\(y=x-[x]\\) 是以 \\(1\\) 为周期的周期函数，应选 \\((D)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[7],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[32],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(D)：\\(x-[x]\\) 是以 1 为周期的周期函数。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.14","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.14","question_text":"例1.14：已知 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x^2}\\) 存在，且 \\(f(x)=\\frac{x-\\sin x}{x}+x^2\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{1-\\cos x}\\)，则 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x^2}=\\)（A）\\(-\\frac13\\)（B）\\frac13\\（C）\\frac16\\（D）\\(-\\frac16\\）。","solution_text":"官方解答：记 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x^2}=A\\)。当 \\(x\\to0\\) 时，\\(\\frac{f(x)}{x^2}=\\frac{x-\\sin x}{x^3}+\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{1-\\cos x}\\)。又 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x^2}{1-\\cos x}=2\\)，故 \\(A=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x-\\sin x}{x^3}+2A=\\frac16+2A\\)，解得 \\(A=-\\frac16\\)，应选 \\((D)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[7],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[35,36],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(D)：\\(-\\frac16\\)。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.15","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.15","question_text":"P37 例1.15：当 \\(x\\to1\\) 时，函数 \\(\\frac{e^{\\frac1{x-1}}\\ln|1+x|}{(e^x-1)(x-2)}\\) 的极限（A）等于1（B）等于0（C）为\\(\\infty\\)（D）不存在且不为\\(\\infty\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：当 \\(x\\to1^-\\) 时，\\(x-1\\to0^-\\)，\\(\\frac1{e^{x-1}}\\to+\\infty\\)，从而 \\(\\frac{e^{1/(x-1)}\\ln|1+x|}{(e^x-1)(x-2)}\\to0\\)；当 \\(x\\to1^+\\) 时，\\(x-1\\to0^+\\)，\\(\\frac1{e^{x-1}}\\to-\\infty\\)，该式趋于 \\(-\\infty\\)。左右极限不相等，故极限不存在且不为 \\(\\infty\\)，应选 \\((D)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[8],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[43,44],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(D)：极限不存在且不为 ∞。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_example.16","category":"textbook_example","number":"例1.16","question_text":"例1.16：设 \\(g(x)=\\begin{cases}2-x,&x\\le0\\\\2+x,&x>0\\end{cases}\\)，\\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2,&x<0\\\\-x-1,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}\\)，则 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}g[f(x)]\\)（A）为3（B）为2（C）为1（D）不存在。","solution_text":"官方解答：由例 1.5 的分段复合计算，\\(g[f(x)]=\\begin{cases}3+x,&x\\ge0,\\\\2+x^2,&x<0.\\end{cases}\\) 因此 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0^+}g[f(x)]=3\\)，\\(\\lim_{x\\to0^-}g[f(x)]=2\\)，左右极限不相等，故 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}g[f(x)]\\) 不存在，应选 \\((D)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[8],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[44],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(D)：极限不存在。","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.01","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.1","question_text":"1.1 第一讲习题：1.1 若 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin x+x f(x)}{x^3}=0\\)，则 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1+f(x)}{x^2}\\) 为（A）0（B）\\(1/3\\)（C）\\(1/6\\)（D）\\(\\infty\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(\\frac{\\sin x+xf(x)}{x^3}=\\frac{\\sin x-x}{x^3}+\\frac{1+f(x)}{x^2}\\)。前一项极限为 \\(-\\frac16\\)，而题设整体极限为 \\(0\\)，故 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1+f(x)}{x^2}=\\frac16\\)，选 \\((C)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[20],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[76],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(C)，\\(1/6\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.02","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.2","question_text":"设 \\(f(x)\\) 在 \\((−\\infty,+\\infty)\\) 内有定义，且 \\(\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}f(x)=a\\)，\\(g(x)=\\begin{cases}f(1/x),&x\\ne0\\\\0,&x=0\\end{cases}\\)，则（A）\\(x=0\\) 是g的第一类间断点（B）第二类间断点（C）连续点（D）g在0处连续性与a取值有关。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(\\lim_{x\\to0}g(x)=\\lim_{x\\to0}f(1/x)=\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}f(x)=a\\)，而 \\(g(0)=0\\)。当且仅当 \\(a=0\\) 时 \\(g\\) 在 \\(0\\) 连续；当 \\(a\\ne0\\) 时不连续，故连续性与 \\(a\\) 有关，选 \\((D)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[20],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[76],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(D)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.03","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.3","question_text":"1.3 设函数 \\(f(x)=\\frac1{e^{1/x}-1}\\)，则（A）\\(x=0,x=1\\) 都是第一类间断点（B）都为第二类（C）\\(x=0\\)第一类、\\(x=1\\)第二类（D）\\(x=0\\)第二类、\\(x=1\\)第一类。","solution_text":"官方解答：仅需讨论无定义点 \\(x=0,1\\)。\\(\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac1{e^{1/x}-1}\\) 不存在（分别趋近 \\(0\\) 与 \\(-1\\)），故 \\(0\\) 为第二类间断点；\\(\\lim_{x\\to1^+}f(x)=0\\)，\\(\\lim_{x\\to1^-}f(x)=-1\\)，故 \\(1\\) 为第一类间断点，选 \\((D)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[21],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[76,77],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(D)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.04","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.4","question_text":"函数 \\(f(x)=\\lim_{t\\to0}(1+\\frac{\\sin t}{x})^{x^2/t}\\) 在 \\((−\\infty,+\\infty)\\) 内（A）连续（B）有可去间断点（C）有跳跃间断点（D）有无穷间断点。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(f(x)=\\lim_{t\\to0}(1+\\frac{\\sin t}{x})^{x^2/t}=e^x\\)（\\(x\\ne0\\)）。且题中函数在 \\(x=0\\) 无定义，而 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}e^x=1\\)，故 \\(x=0\\) 为可去间断点，选 \\((B)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[21],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[77],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(B)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.05","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.5","question_text":"1.5 设函数 \\(f(x)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{1+x}{1+x^{2n}}\\)，关于该函数的间断点，正确的是（A）不存在间断点（B）存在间断点x=1（C）存在间断点x=0（D）存在间断点x=−1。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(|x|<1\\) 时 \\(x^{2n}\\to0\\)，故 \\(f(x)=1+x\\)；\\(|x|>1\\) 时 \\(x^{2n}\\to\\infty\\)，故 \\(f(x)=0\\)。又 \\(f(1)=1\\)、\\(f(-1)=0\\)，因此 \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}0,&x\\le-1,\\\\1+x,&-1<x<1,\\\\1,&x=1,\\\\0,&x>1.\\end{cases}\\) 仅 \\(x=1\\) 为间断点，选 \\((B)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[22],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[77],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"(B)，间断点 x=1","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.06","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.6","question_text":"设函数 \\(f(x)=\\frac{x}{1+x}\\)，\\(x\\in[0,1]\\)，定义函数列 \\(f_1(x)=f(x), f_2(x)=f[f_1(x)],\\ldots,f_n(x)=f[f_{n-1}(x)]\\ (n=1,2,\\ldots)\\)，则 \\(f_n(x)=\\underline{\\hspace{2cm}}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(f_2(x)=f[f_1(x)]=\\frac{x}{1+2x}\\)，\\(f_3(x)=\\frac{x}{1+3x}\\)。由数学归纳法，\\(f_n(x)=\\frac{x}{1+nx}\\;(n=1,2,3,\\ldots)\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[22],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[77],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(f_n(x)=\\frac{x}{1+nx}\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.07","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.7","question_text":"1.7 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{1-\\sqrt{\\cos x}}{x(1-\\cos\\sqrt{x})}=\\underline{\\hspace{2cm}}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：有理化得 \\(\\frac{1-\\sqrt{\\cos x}}{x(1-\\cos\\sqrt{x})}=\\frac{1-\\cos x}{x(1-\\cos\\sqrt{x})(1+\\sqrt{\\cos x})}\\)。利用 \\(1-\\cos x\\sim\\frac12x^2\\)、\\(1-\\cos\\sqrt{x}\\sim\\frac12x\\) 且 \\(1+\\sqrt{\\cos x}\\to2\\)，极限为 \\(\\frac12\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[23],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[77],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(1/2\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.08","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.8","question_text":"\\(\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac{x+2}{x-1}\\right)^x=\\underline{\\hspace{2cm}}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(\\left(\\frac{x+2}{x-1}\\right)^x=\\frac{(1+2/x)^x}{(1-1/x)^x}\\to\\frac{e^2}{e^{-1}}=e^3\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[23],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[78],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(e^3\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.09","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.9","question_text":"1.9 已知 \\(a>0,b>0\\)，则 \\(\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}x(a^{1/x}-b^{1/x})=\\underline{\\hspace{2cm}}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：令 \\(t=1/x\\)，则 \\(x(a^{1/x}-b^{1/x})=\\frac{a^t-b^t}{t}\\)。当 \\(t\\to0^+\\) 时，该极限为 \\(a^t\\ln a-b^t\\ln b\\to\\ln\\frac ab\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[24],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[78],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(\\ln(a/b)\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.10","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.10","question_text":"设函数 \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\frac{1-e^{\\tan x}}{\\arcsin(x/2)},&x>0\\\\ae^{2x},&x\\le0\\end{cases}\\)，在 \\(x=0\\) 处连续，则 \\(a=\\underline{\\hspace{2cm}}\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：连续性要求左右极限等于 \\(f(0)=a\\)。\\(\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{1-e^{\\tan x}}{\\arcsin(x/2)}=\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{-\\tan x}{x/2}=-2\\)，\\(\\lim_{x\\to0^-}ae^{2x}=a\\)，故 \\(a=-2\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[24],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[78],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(a=-2\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.11","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.11","question_text":"1.11 设 \\(f(x)=\\arcsin(\\sin x)\\)，画出 \\(f(x)\\) 的图形。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(f(x+2\\pi)=\\arcsin[\\sin(x+2\\pi)]=f(x)\\)。当 \\(x\\in[-\\frac\\pi2,\\frac\\pi2]\\) 时 \\(f(x)=x\\)；当 \\(x\\in[\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2]\\) 时 \\(f(x)=\\pi-x\\)。一般地，对 \\(k\\in\\mathbb Z\\)，\\(f(x)=x-2k\\pi\\)（\\(-\\frac\\pi2+2k\\pi\\le x\\le\\frac\\pi2+2k\\pi\\)），\\(f(x)=(2k+1)\\pi-x\\)（\\(\\frac\\pi2+2k\\pi\\le x\\le\\frac{3\\pi}2+2k\\pi\\)）；图像为相应三角波。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[25],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[78,79],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"以 \\(2\\pi\\) 为周期的三角波","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.12","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.12","question_text":"求极限 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac{e^x+xe^x}{e^x-1}-\\frac1x\\right)\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(e^x-1\\sim x\\)。通分后 \\(\\frac{e^x+xe^x}{e^x-1}-\\frac1x=\\frac{xe^x(1+x)+1-e^x}{x(e^x-1)}\\)。用洛必达法则（或展开）得极限 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{3e^x+x^2e^x}{2x e^x}=\\frac32\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[25],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[79],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(3/2\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.13","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.13","question_text":"1.13 求极限 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac{a_1^x+a_2^x+\\cdots+a_n^x}{n}\\right)^{n/x}\\)，其中 \\(a_i>0,i=1,2,\\ldots,n\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：原式为 \\(1^\\infty\\) 型。写成 \\(\\exp\\{\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac n x[\\frac{a_1^x+\\cdots+a_n^x}{n}-1]\\}\\)，由 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{a_i^x-1}{x}=\\ln a_i\\)，指数为 \\(\\ln(a_1a_2\\cdots a_n)\\)，故极限为 \\(a_1a_2\\cdots a_n\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[26],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[79,80],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(a_1a_2\\cdots a_n\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.14","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.14","question_text":"已知 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left[a\\frac{2+e^{1/x}}{1+e^{1/x/4}}+(1+|x|)^{1/x}\\right]\\) 存在，求 \\(a\\) 的值。","solution_text":"官方解答：右极限为 \\(0+e=e\\)；左极限为 \\(2a+e^{-1}\\)。由极限存在，\\(e=2a+e^{-1}\\)，所以 \\(a=\\frac e2-\\frac1{2e}\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[26],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[80],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(a=\\frac e2-\\frac1{2e}\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.15","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.15","question_text":"1.15 设 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\ln(1+x)-(ax+bx^2)}{x^2}=2\\)，求常数 \\(a,b\\)。","solution_text":"官方解答：\\(\\ln(1+x)=x-\\frac12x^2+o(x^2)\\)，故题设极限为 \\(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{(1-a)x+(-\\frac12-b)x^2+o(x^2)}{x^2}=2\\)。于是 \\(a=1\\)，且 \\(-\\frac12-b=2\\)，故 \\(b=-\\frac52\\)。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[27],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[80],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(a=1,\\ b=-\\frac52\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
{"item_id":"math2.ch01.textbook_exercise.16","category":"textbook_example","number":"1.16","question_text":"求常数 \\(a,b\\) 的值，使得函数 \\(f(x)=x-(a+b\\cos x)\\sin x\\) 在 \\(x\\to0\\) 时是 \\(x\\) 的5阶无穷小。","solution_text":"官方解答：恒等变形 \\(f(x)=x-a\\sin x-\\frac12b\\sin2x\\)。代入 \\(\\sin x=x-\\frac{x^3}{6}+\\frac{x^5}{120}+o(x^5)\\)，\\(\\sin2x=2x-\\frac43x^3+\\frac4{15}x^5+o(x^5)\\)，得 \\(f(x)=(1-a-b)x+(\\frac a6+\\frac{2b}{3})x^3-(\\frac a{120}+\\frac{2b}{15})x^5+o(x^5)\\)。为 x 的 5 阶无穷小，须 \\(1-a-b=0\\)、\\(\\frac a6+\\frac{2b}{3}=0\\)，解得 \\(a=\\frac43,b=-\\frac13\\)，且五次项系数非零。","question_source_file":"张宇30讲高数例题.pdf","question_source_pages":[27],"solution_source_file":"27张宇基础30讲（高数）_新书签.pdf","solution_source_pages":[81],"mapping_status":"page_range_assigned","official_answer_text_or_katex":"\\(a=\\frac43,\\ b=-\\frac13\\)","answer_confirmation":"source_page_confirmed","question_figure_presence":"needs_review","solution_figure_presence":"unknown","item_specific_analysis":"","status":"question_and_solution_text_confirmed","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","rejection_reason":null,"question_recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed"}
